    <h1>AWS Lambda for AI <span class="accent">Inference</span></h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">Serverless inference with Lambda: deployment, cold start optimization, integrating SageMaker, and handling API requests at scale</p>
  </section>

  <div class="objectives"><h4>Learning Objectives</h4><ul>
    <li>Deploy ML models to AWS Lambda for serverless inference</li>
    <li>Understand Lambda execution environment and constraints (memory, timeout, size limits)</li>
    <li>Optimize cold starts with provisioned concurrency and container images</li>
    <li>Integrate Lambda with API Gateway for HTTP endpoints</li>
